xpose upside to 0.8808 (Wednesday's high), then 0.8824-0.8830 band (Tuesday's high-Aug. 15 high), 0.8885 (Aug. 10 high, roughly matching July 26 reaction high) and 0.9000 (July 8 high). Support at 0.8682 (hourly chart), then at 0.8652 (Friday's low); breach would target 0.8640 (Aug. 5 low), then 0.8606 (May 26 swing low), 0.8528 (uptrend support line from June 29, 2010 low of 0.8065 on weekly chart) and 0.8458 (March 1 reaction low).\par \par \uc2 -By Jerry Tan, Dow Jones Newswires; (65) 6415-4046; Jerry.tan@dowjones.com [ 21-08-11 2330GMT ]\par \par \uc2 This is a financial news and information service. It is provided in general terms and does not take account of or address any individual user's position. To the extent that this article includes suggestions as to various possible investment strategies which users might consider, it does so in only general terms without reference to the personal factors which should determine any user's investment decisions. Nothing contained in this service constitutes personalized investment advice. Dow Jones does not warrant the accuracy, completeness or timeliness of the information in this article, and any errors shall not be made the basis for any claim against Dow Jones. The author does not invest in the instruments or markets cited in this article. This article does not constitute or form part of any invitation or inducement to buy or sell any security.\par \par \uc2 [ 21-08-11 2330GMT ]\par \par \uc2 1075 4033   \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020110821e78l0002t\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
