 reached a record 4 trillion yen ($50.6 billion).\par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2  will officially announce on Aug. 31 how much it spent on \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in August.  \par \par \uc2 (Reporting by Hideyuki Sano; Editing by Michael Watson)\par \par \uc2 MARKETS-\b \highlight22\uc2 FOREX\b0 \highlight\uc2 /\b \highlight22\uc2 INTERVENTION\b0 \highlight\uc2 (URGENT)   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020110808e785000tb\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
